# .NET runtime 10.0.14 (Microsoft.NETCore.App only, linux-x64; 2026-10-25, a security release, 16 days
# old on 2026-11-10). DOTNET_RUNTIME_SHA512 is the hash Microsoft publishes for the file in
# https://dotnetcli.blob.core.windows.net/dotnet/release-metadata/10.0/releases.json. Needs only libc,
# libstdc++, libgcc_s and zlib (all in the base image); no ICU (invariant globalization).
